{"id": "21-1106-2-10", "zh": "家族、世系、传承、出身、氏族、血统（kula、vaṃsa、santāna、abhijana、gotta、anvaya），这些都是同义词；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1107-2-9", "zh": "santati 用作阴性时也是这个意思。种姓（vaṇṇa）有四种，即刹帝利等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1109-2-5", "zh": "出身良家的人：kulīna、sajjana、sādhu、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1110-2-5", "zh": "sabhya、ayya、mahākula；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1111-2-9", "zh": "国王：rājā、bhūpati、bhūpāla、patthiva、narādhipa、", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1113-2-8", "zh": "bhūnātha、jagatipāla、disampati、janādhipa、", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1114-2-8", "zh": "raṭṭhādhipa、naradeva、bhūmipa、bhūbhuja。接下来：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1116-2-8", "zh": "刹帝利：rājañña、khattiya、khatta、muddhābhisitta、bāhuja；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1117-2-7", "zh": "统治全地的君主：sabbabhumma、cakkavattī（转轮王）；其他国王称为一方之主（maṇḍalissara）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1119-2-12", "zh": "离车人（阳性）：licchavi、vajjī；释迦族人：sakya、sākiya；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1120-2-16", "zh": "罗睺罗的母亲：Bhaddakaccānā（复注本作 Bhaddā Kaccānā）、Bimbā、Yasodharā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1122-2-8", "zh": "储藏的财富最少有一百俱胝（koṭi），", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1123-2-7", "zh": "每天花费二十安巴纳（ambaṇa）迦哈波那钱（kahāpaṇa）的人，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1125-2-8", "zh": "就是刹帝利大富者（khattiyamahāsāla）。储藏的财富有八十俱胝、", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1126-2-8", "zh": "每天花费十安巴纳的人，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1128-2-7", "zh": "就是婆罗门大富者（dvijamahāsāla）。储藏的财富是这个数目的一半、", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1129-2-9", "zh": "每天的花费也是一半的人，就是居士大富者（gahapatimahāsāla）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1131-2-7", "zh": "大臣：mahāmatta、padhāna、matisajīva、mantī、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1132-2-10", "zh": "sajīva、saciva、macca；将军：senānī、camūpati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1134-2-7", "zh": "裁决寄存财物等纠纷的法官：akkhadassa、padaṭṭhara；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1135-2-7", "zh": "守门人：dovārika、patīhāra、dvāraṭṭha、dvārapālaka。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1137-2-8", "zh": "国王的护卫队称为**近卫军**（anīkaṭṭha）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1138-2-9", "zh": "后宫侍卫：kañcukī、sovidalla；侍从：anujīvī、sevaka。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1140-2-5", "zh": "主管官员：ajjhakkha、adhikata；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1141-2-5", "zh": "司库：heraññika、nikkhika；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1142-2-9", "zh": "与本国相邻的国王是敌人，再往外的国王是盟友。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1144-2-17", "zh": "敌人：amitta、ripu、verī、sapatta、arāti、sattu、ari（satva’ri 即 sattu 加 ari）；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1145-2-7", "zh": "paccatthika、paripanthī、paṭipakkha、ahitapara、", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1147-2-8", "zh": "paccāmitta、vipakkha、paccanīka、virodhī、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1148-2-10", "zh": "viddesī、disa、diṭṭha。顺从：anurodha、anuvattana。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1150-2-17", "zh": "朋友：mitta（非阴性）、vayassa、sahāya、suhada（复注本作 suhajja）、sakhā；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1151-2-8", "zh": "亲密的朋友：sambhatta、daḷhamitta；只见过面的朋友：sandiṭṭha、diṭṭhamattaka。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1153-2-10", "zh": "密探：cara、guḷhapurisa；旅人：pathāvī、pathika、addhagū；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1154-2-9", "zh": "使者：dūta、sandesahara；占时师：gaṇaka、muhuttika。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1156-2-11", "zh": "书记员：lekhaka、lipikāra；字母：vaṇṇa、akkhara。接下来：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1157-2-10", "zh": "离间（bheda）、惩罚（daṇḍa）、怀柔（sāma）、赠予（dāna），这四种是治国的策略（upāya）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1159-2-10", "zh": "离间：upajāpa、bheda；惩罚：daṇḍa、sāhasa、dama；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1161-2-11", "zh": "君主、大臣、盟友、国库、城堡、领土、军队，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1162-2-9", "zh": "这七种称为**王国的支分**（rajjaṅga），也称为要素（pakati）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1164-2-12", "zh": "由威势、勇气、谋略而有三种力量（satti）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1165-2-5", "zh": "威势（pabhāva）是由刑罚与军力而生的威力（teja），", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1166-2-6", "zh": "而威光（patāpa）是由国库而生的。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1168-2-10", "zh": "谋议：manta、mantana；只有两人知道的谋议称为四耳（catukkaṇṇa），", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1169-2-9", "zh": "有三人知道的称为六耳（chakkaṇṇa）。秘密称为 rahassa、guyha。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1171-2-11", "zh": "偏僻无人的（三性通用）：vivitta、vijana、channa；私下：raho，raho 是不变词；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1172-2-6", "zh": "信任：vissāsa、vissambha；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1173-2-7", "zh": "适宜的（三性通用）：yutta、opāyika。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1175-2-7", "zh": "教诫：ovāda、anusiṭṭhi（阴性）、anusāsana（非阳性）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1176-2-11", "zh": "命令应知为 āṇā、sāsana；摘要：uddāna、bandhana。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1178-2-17", "zh": "过失：āgu、vutta（迦本作 mantu）、aparādha；赋税称为 kara、bali；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1179-2-9", "zh": "令人欢喜的赏赐：puṇṇapatta、tuṭṭhidāya；礼物：upadā、pābhata、", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1181-2-9", "zh": "以及 upāyana、ukkoca、paṇṇākāra、paheṇaka；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1182-2-11", "zh": "在关卡等处应缴纳的称为关税（suṅka，非阴性）；收入：āya、dhanāgama。", "confidence": 60}
